  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ambient: Encompassing Malaria Elimination Activities in India - India (01-Apr-2024-31-Mar-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India, Malaria, T.C.I. Foundation (TCIF)This program has the following goals: Eliminate malaria (zero indigeneous cases) throughout the country by 2030.. The objectives of this program are: Interrupt indigeneous transmission of Malaria throughout the country, including all high transmission states and union territories (Category 3) by 2027.  Prevent re-establishment of local transmission of malaria in areas where it has been eliminated</narrative>
  </description>
